#X text 20 700 div 10 is the kind and mod 10 which one. Routing on the kind gives each its own makefilename., f 46;
#X text 620 700 The transport row is kind 4 (CC 41-46) \, so it takes the button path: press only \, no state., f 46;
#X text 1180 700 Named by physical position \, never by function: what a control does is u_map's., f 46;
#X text 1180 860 route's reject is the validity check: only kinds 0 to 4 have a name., f 46;
